<title>USA: PaineWebber wins $36.5 mln Pittsburgh, Pa., GOs.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber wins $36.5 mln Pittsburgh, Pa., GOs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said it won $36.5 million of Pittsburgh School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 4.76 percent.</p>
